    변수 조각2은 "  call void asm sideeffect \"adrp x6, hmje_global_h_m_j_e___c_p_u___l_o_c_a_l___d_a_t_a\\0A\\09add x6, x6, :lo12:hmje_global_h_m_j_e___c_p_u___l_o_c_a_l___d_a_t_a\\0A\\09ldr x6, [x6]\\0A\\09mrs x5, tpidr_el1\\0A\\09lsl x5, x5, #9\\0A\\09add x5, x6, x5\\0A\\09adr x6, .Lhmje_copy_to_user_fault\\0A\\09str x6, [x5, #312]\\0A\\09mov x3, #0\\0A.Lhmje_copy_to_user_loop:\\0A\\09cmp x3, x2\\0A\\09b.hs .Lhmje_copy_to_user_done\\0"이고, 문자열이다.
    조각2은 문자열붙인값(조각2, "A\\09ldrb w4, [x1, x3]\\0A\\09strb w4, [x0, x3]\\0A\\09add x3, x3, #1\\0A\\09b .Lhmje_copy_to_user_loop\\0A.Lhmje_copy_to_user_done:\\0A\\09str xzr, [x5, #312]\\0A\\09mov x0, #0\\0A\\09ret\\0A.Lhmje_copy_to_user_fault:\\0A\\09mov x0, #-14\\0A\\09ret\", \"~{x0},~{x3},~{x4},~{x5},~{x6},~{memory}\"()")이다.
